The native BFD implementation in this directory is original routerd2 code under
the repository's BSD-3-Clause license. Protocol behavior was implemented from
RFC 5880 and RFC 5881; RFC 5883 identifies the separately unsupported multihop
application. No FRR, bfdd, vtysh, other BFD implementation, or RFC code component
is copied or linked into this package.

The original routerd BFDSpec and FRR bridge were inspected at source commit
1329ef54f296507eda79bbbc3b853783dd27251e to identify migration boundaries. The
native implementation uses existing repository dependencies for Linux syscall
and read-only netlink access (golang.org/x/sys/unix and
github.com/vishvananda/netlink). The integration-only fixture also uses the
already declared github.com/vishvananda/netns dependency. Their applicable
license notices remain in the project's dependency distribution.
